<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (At HuLib, we believe that there is a story in all of us, and we are born to be somebody. Our vision is to create a safe and proactive community where stories are shared and heard, where young people uncertain about their future can connect with professional mentors who guide them on their unique paths.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
258 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Sponsorship of HuLib offers your company a unique opportunity to showcase your brand, products, and services to a young and engaged audience. We offer a range of sponsorship packages to suit your company's marketing and philanthropic objectives. In return for your generous sponsorship, we are committed to providing prominent visibility and recognition for your company.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
